      "updated_at": "2026-09-04T08:17:20Z",
      "body": "Good call out, I missed that from the `structuredClone` algorithm; so definitely it is sadly a limitation when throwing a native `Error` instance\n\nI believe is worth it to document this for people facing the same behavior.\nWould you like to send a PR for that?",
