      "body": "sgtm!\n\n>Add an option to automatically wrap workers with serialize-error.\n\nI'm hesitant to add a library to Piscina, specially now that is dependency-less; but we can bring the logic into it. We have been assessing trying to implement a similar customization of serialization\n\n",
